  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice) and bring to the boil. • Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. • Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don&#39;t peek!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83e000d0527cba53a8533/step-fb420e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice red onion (see ingredients). • In a small bowl, combine the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt. • Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add it to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover onion. Set aside.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83e000d0527cba53a8533/step-2ed73110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Slice avocado in half and scoop out flesh. Slice lemon into wedges. • In a medium bowl, mash avocado with a squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil until smooth. Season to taste and set aside.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83e000d0527cba53a8533/step-ce365920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. • Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. • Add Tex-Mex spice blend and tomato paste, and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute. • Add the water (for the mince), and simmer until slightly thickened, 1 minute. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83e000d0527cba53a8533/step-e536d830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the mince is cooking, finely chop tomato. • In a medium bowl, combine tomato with a drizzle of olive oil and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83e000d0527cba53a8533/step-d391e840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain pickled onion. Bring everything to the table. • Build your own plate with rice, Tex-Mex plant-based mince, guacamole, pickled onion, zingy tomato, Cheddar cheese and sour cream. • Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. • If you&#39;ve selected an add on bundle, serve with roasted corn cobs. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83e000d0527cba53a8533/step-99e3ce50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
